msgid "Did you hear? There was a shooting at one of the hostess clubs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "What!? No way! What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Apparently, somebody tried to kill some politician's secretary⑬like an "
"assassination attempt or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I had no idea the clubs here could be so dangerous. Maybe I should give up "
"trying to work at one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Sounds like a good idea. Besides, I think you'd have a much better chance "
"at becoming a celebrity if you worked as a dancer in Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

